# Terror kills the opponent's Bears. Bridge from Below in the human's graveyard
# watches (TriggerZones$ Graveyard): the creature went to an opponent's
# graveyard, so the second line exiles Bridge (IsPresent$ Card.StrictlySelf in
# the graveyard); the first, for the human's own nontoken creature, stays quiet.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
tapformana human 3 B
queue paygeneric B
queue targets 5
castspell human 1
resolvestack
